    "why_this_verification": "pdftotext -layout breaks the row correspondence of Table S3, so a text-order reading assigns one donor's clearance to another. Reproducing twenty correlation coefficients the article itself published, each of which would move far more than the tolerance under a single mis-assigned row, is what makes the coordinate reconstruction trustworthy."
