  "what_table_s1_does_not_give": "Table S1 reports donor characteristics as aggregates only: age mean 64 (39-79), BMI mean 25.7 (20.1-32.9), 10 male and 5 female, 13 colorectal cancer, 1 breast cancer, 1 GIST. There is no per-donor age, sex, BMI or diagnosis, so no per-donor demographic baseline block can be built for these 15 donors.",
  "why_a_text_dump_will_not_do": "pdftotext -layout misaligns the clearance cells against the batch labels in this table. Any transcription that does not verify against the article's own published statistics should be assumed to have mis-assigned donors."
